    <h1 class="msv-hero__title">How to Get a Spanish Social Security Number: Complete Guide</h1>
    <p class="msv-hero__intro">If you're working in Spain — whether employed or self-employed — you need a Spanish social security number (número de afiliación a la Seguridad Social). It's also the gateway to accessing public healthcare, contributing to a Spanish pension, and registering as autónomo (self-employed). This guide explains exactly how to get one.</p>
  </div>
